                    "text": "We need answer in one or two sentences. Explain Rust and why memory safety matters. Concise. Could mention Rust is systems language with compile-time ownership/borrow checker preventing memory errors. Memory safety matters because bugs like use-after-free, buffer overflows lead to crashes/security vulnerabilities. Two sentences. Ensure accurate."
